# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your real Web3Forms access key.
#
# 1. Go to https://web3forms.com/
# 2. Enter thehimalayanramble@gmail.com and click "Create Access Key" —
#    no account or password needed, the key is emailed to that inbox
#    instantly.
# 3. Paste the key below.
#
# Free, no submission cap, no card required — the destination email is
# whatever address you used to create the key, so as long as you entered
# thehimalayanramble@gmail.com, every enquiry lands there automatically.
#
# Until this is set, the contact form still validates and submits, but
# ContactForm shows a dev-only console warning instead of actually reaching
# Web3Forms — see src/components/contact/contact-form.tsx.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
